    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers, or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nThe best of both worlds - surrounded by private mature gardens but a stroll from Tallow town centre!Situated on West Street, within walking distance of the town centre, this 2 bed detached bungalow is nestled on a most private site with its picturesque entrance beside the stone bridge of the River Glenaboy on the street. The property has a private entrance driveway and is concealed to an extent by mature hedges and trees with ample parking space to the front. Inside, the property is spacious and bright. The main living room is to the front of the property and has views to the gardens with a fitted stove. The kitchen faces to the rear garden and has fitted units and a utility/WC room adjoining with door to the garden. The 2 bedrooms are of ample size and are accessed via the main hallway with the main looking to the rear garden. There is a main bathroom to the front of the property.Externally, there is a private rear lawned garden with patio area. The site then extends beyond this area to a larger garden that also runs alongside towards the entrance. This area has polytunnels and garden sheds and is an outdoor persons dream.This property would make the perfect home and locations don't come much better, located a stroll from all local amenities."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Large private 0.47 acre approx. site in town centre.</li><li>Prime location on a popular road.</li><li>A stroll to town centre.</li><li>Impressive mature private lawned gardens. </li><li>Polytunnel and gardens sheds.</li><li>Oil fired central heating.</li><li>Mains water & sewerage.</ul>"
      },
      {
